Graffiti Tools - licensing policy
=================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Tip of the Aero contributors.

This repository contains materials under different licenses. This file
summarizes which license applies; the complete operative license terms
are in LICENSES/.

Hardware design source and outputs
  CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal
  SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  Includes the parametric CAD model sources under tools/*/src/, and the
  STEP/STL files generated from those designs.

General-purpose software
  Apache License, Version 2.0
  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
  Includes shared build/validation scripts, CI helper software, and
  general-purpose software tests.

Documentation and original media
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
  Includes original documentation, diagrams, renders, and photographs.

A file-specific SPDX declaration overrides these general categories.
Third-party content retains its own licensing and attribution terms.
Model-specific tests closely tied to a hardware design may be licensed
with that design; general-purpose tests are Apache-2.0.

The project name and trademarks are not licensed for endorsement.
No warranty or guarantee of fit, safety, or universal compatibility is
provided. Test-fit aerosol accessories without actuating the valve.

